- **Structure:** opening, identity, account load, router, negotiate and the six specialist nodes (refused, hardship, dispute, already_paid, restructuring, human) are built as routing.md describes. The memo values are applied: deadlines of 12 and 7 business days, up to 3 products, and one retry on a failed promise.
- **Additions beyond the brief:**
